  "{"model":"gpt-6-luna","reasoning":{"effort":"none"},"store":false,"max_output_tokens":1200,"instructions":"You write daily tasks for Murph, an iPhone game: two people do the same task each day for a week and post a photo as proof. More days done wins.\\nWrite 12 tasks, every one fitting what they typed (words in the request data), the way a friend would take it.\\nA good task is a real thing people do for their health, takes real effort but fits into a normal day, is clear about when it is done, and reads as a short chip under 28 characters.\\nThe week was about Move more (cardio and steps, no strength moves like pushups or squats), but what they typed comes first.\\nSay it the way people say it. Counts come first (\\"15 pushups\\", \\"20 calf raises\\"). Timed things put the activity first (\\"Plank 30 sec\\", \\"Walk 30 min\\", \\"Jump rope 10 min\\"). Keep a verb only when the task needs one (\\"Walk 30 min\\", \\"Read 10 pages\\"). No \\"Do\\", no \\"for\\", no describing words like brisk, easy, light, slowly, quietly, bodyweight or cozy.\\nBoth people do the same task, so say \\"the dog\\", never \\"my\\" or \\"your\\". Nothing that assumes kids, a pet, a car, a yard or a job unless they typed so.\\nNever two that differ only in the number or a word or two.\\nLeave out gimmicks, props used for their own sake, jokes, exercise names a normal person would not know, chores that are not daily by nature (trash, laundry, plants), anything you avoid rather than do, and anything trivial (stand up, drink a glass of water, take a few deep breaths, take a break, 1,000 steps).\\nschedule says which days count: weekdays for real exercise; every_day only for light habits a normal person does 7 days a week (stretching, a short walk, sleep, reading, journaling, phone limits, meals); three_days for anything most people could not repeat five days in a row (long runs, hikes, 5k or more, 50 or more reps, hard workouts, games of a sport like tennis, soccer or basketball).","input":"{\\"step\\":\\"task\\",\\"category\\":\\"move\\",\\"relationship\\":\\"friend\\",\\"apart\\":false,\\"directions\\":[],\\"words\\":\\"we both hate running\\",\\"skipped\\":[]}","text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"game_ideas","strict":true,"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["ideas"],"properties":{"ideas":{"type":"array","maxItems":12,"items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["text","schedule"],"properties":{"text":{"type":"string","maxLength":120},"schedule":{"type":"string","enum":["every_day","weekdays","three_days"]}}}}}}}}}",
